## User Secrets & App Settings secrets (if any)
# appsettings.json
# appsettings.Development.json
# Note: Keep appsettings.json template but ignore actual secrets. 
# Usually, we can check in appsettings.json if it contains no secrets or template values.
# Since we have default connection strings, let's keep appsettings.json versioned so developers have a baseline,
# but make sure user secrets aren't checked in.

